Thank You for Coming!

Dear <%= @ticket.attendee_name.presence || 'friend' %>,

Thank you for being with us at <%= @event.title %>. An event is only as special as the people who show up, and having you there made all the difference.

We hope you went home with something to remember, whether that's a new idea, a new friend, or just a good day well spent.
<% if @feedback_url %>

We'd love to hear from you. Your thoughts help us make the next one even better:
<%= @feedback_url %>
<% end %>

<% if @contact_email.present? %>
If there's anything you'd like to tell us, reach out anytime at <%= @contact_email %>.

<% end %>
Until we meet again, take care, and we hope to see you soon.

With gratitude,
<%= @sender_name %>

